%% UML 2.5 state machine. Transition label syntax: trigger [guard] / effect.
%% Source: QuestionApprovalService, QuestionLifecycleService, QuestionLifecyclePolicy
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT : / create question or revision
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL : author submits for approval
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : academic approves
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT : reject / record rejection_reason
  DRAFT --> APPROVED : academic publishes directly
  APPROVED --> ARCHIVED : archive
  APPROVED --> ARCHIVED : superseded by a new revision
  DRAFT --> ARCHIVED : archive [ever_published]
  ARCHIVED --> DRAFT : unarchive [not superseded]
  note right of APPROVED
    is_current marks the current revision within revision_group_public_id
  end note
